{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42566","headline":"题桃源 · 李宏臯","name":"题桃源","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山翠参差水渺茫，秦人昔在楚封[疆]。\n当时避世乾坤窄，此地安家日月长。\n草色几经坛杏老，岩花犹带涧桃香。\n他年倘遂平生志，来着霞衣侍玉皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李宏臯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}